%[text] With the model complete, you can visualize the motion. The  `sim` command simulates a completed mass-spring-damper model, `msdSimulationOutput.slx`. The local function `animateMSD` creates an animation of the output from the model.
n = 150; % The number of steps used in the visualization %[control:slider:648a]{"position":[5,8]}
visualize = true; % Click the checkbox to show the visualization %[control:checkbox:6d35]{"position":[13,17]}
if(visualize)
